        "Word Constituents",
        "Accents, umlauts, diacritics"
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part5/x-word-constituents",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "Words which contain accents, umlauts, and other diacritics (such as Café, Brontë, Entrepôt, Señor) are indexed both as plain word marks and with the accent, umlats and other diacritics. For example; The word “Señor” would be indexed as both Señor and Senor."
    },
