      "tables": [],
      "text": "Numbers may consist of cardinal numbers (1, 2, 3 etc), other versions of numbers such as words (ten, sixteen, first), roman numerals (IV, L) and ordinals (1st, 5th). NUM - This constituent is added to all marks containing numbers"
