      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part5/x-word-constituents",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [
        {
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "text": "EASY phonetics (all with constituent EASY)"
              },
              {
                "text": "OZZ phonetics (all with constituent OZZ)"
              },
              {
                "text": "QUICK phonetics (all with constituent QUICK)"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "EASE EASY EASI E.A.S.Y. EAZIE EAZY EAZZY EASIER E.A.S.I.E.R. EASIES EAZE E.S.Y. EESE EEESY EECY EEZE EEZEE EEZI EEZZY EEZY EZ E.Z. EZEE EZI EZY E-Z-Y EZ-ZEE EZZY ECI E’SE EEEZEE EESI EEZ EEZE ESE ESI E-Z EZE E-ZE E-Z-E EZE’S E*Z*EST"
              },
              {
                "text": "AUS AUSI AUSIE AUSSIE AUSSIE AUSSIES AUSSY AUSZEE AUZZIE AUZZIES OSS OSSI OSSIE OZ OZI OZEEEE OZZ OZZI OZZEE OZZIE OZZIES OZZY OZZZ WAUSSIE"
              },
              {
                "text": "QUIC QUIK QUYC QUYK QUYQ QUIQ QWIC QWIK QWYC QWYK QWYQ QWIQ QIK QIC QYK CWIC CWIK CWYC CWYK CWYQ CWIQ KWYC KWYK KWYQ KWIQ KWIC KWIK"
              }
            ]
          ],
          "columns": 3,
          "header_row": null,
          "ordinal": 1,
          "rows": 2
        }
      ],
      "text": "Phonetic equivalents of 'easy', 'ozz' and 'quick' are common in trade marks. In order to find all versions of the constituent EASY, OZZ or QUICK is always added. However, words beginning with AUST such as AUSTRALIA, AUSTRALASIAN, AUSTRADE and AUSTRAL do not have the added constituent. If the trade mark is the word EASY, OZZ or QUICK only, then # symbol is added to the word constituent. Below is a list of all the variations which require these added constituents: EASY phonetics (all with constituent EASY) OZZ phonetics (all with constituent OZZ) QUICK phonetics (all with constituent QUICK) EASE EASY EASI E.A.S.Y. EAZIE EAZY EAZZY EASIER E.A.S.I.E.R. EASIES EAZE E.S.Y. EESE EEESY EECY EEZE EEZEE EEZI EEZZY EEZY EZ E.Z. EZEE EZI EZY E-Z-Y EZ-ZEE EZZY ECI E’SE EEEZEE EESI EEZ EEZE ESE ESI E-Z EZE E-ZE E-Z-E EZE’S E*Z*EST AUS AUSI AUSIE AUSSIE AUSSIE AUSSIES AUSSY AUSZEE AUZZIE AUZZIES OSS OSSI OSSIE OZ OZI OZEEEE OZZ OZZI OZZEE OZZIE OZZIES OZZY OZZZ WAUSSIE QUIC QUIK QUYC QUYK QUYQ QUIQ QWIC QWIK QWYC QWYK QWYQ QWIQ QIK QIC QYK CWIC CWIK CWYC CWYK CWYQ CWIQ KWYC KWYK KWYQ KWIQ KWIC KWIK"
    },
